## Bundled liangshen preset (vendor/liangshen)

vendor/liangshen/ is the runtime part (lib, presets, locale, package metadata, LICENSE)
of the npm package @linxin666/dsh-liangshen 0.4.16 by linxin666
(https://www.npmjs.com/package/@linxin666/dsh-liangshen,
source repository: https://github.com/zhu1090093659/dsh-web-ui), Apache License 2.0.
Redistributed here unmodified except for source maps, src/ and tools/, which are not
shipped. Upstream LICENSE is kept at vendor/liangshen/LICENSE. dsh-purge copies this
tree into the active profile at startup and then applies its own "liangshen" patches
(identity line removal, phase-1 injected-section retention) to the copied files.